<br>
At NoGigiddy, we are dedicated to protecting your privacy and ensuring that=
 your personal information is handled with care. This Privacy Policy explai=
ns what information we collect, how we use it, and the measures we take to =
safeguard your data when you visit our website or use our services.=20
<br>
<br>
Your Consent=20
<br>
By accessing our platform, registering for job alerts, or interacting with =
our communications, you agree to the terms outlined in this Privacy Policy =
and in our Terms of Service. Your consent may be provided through form subm=
issions, account creation, or engagement with our online tools and emails.=
=20
<br>
<br>
Information We Collect=20
<br>
To provide a smooth and personalized experience, we gather two types of inf=
ormation:=20
<br>
<br>
Personal Information:=E2=80=A8Details you submit directly, such as your nam=
e, email address, phone number, and job preferences when you sign up or com=
plete forms.=20
<br>
<br>
Technical and Usage Information:=E2=80=A8Automatically collected data inclu=
ding your IP address, browser type, device identifiers, and interaction act=
ivity. This information helps improve site performance and user experience.=
=20
<br>
<br>
How We Use Your Information=20
<br>
We use your information to deliver high-quality services and relevant commu=
nication, including:=20
<br>
* Sending remote job alerts based on your preferences=20
<br>
* Improving the speed, usability, and reliability of our platform=20
<br>
* Sharing updates, service notices, and opportunities that may interest you=
=20
<br>
We do not sell or share your personal information with unrelated third part=
ies. Marketing messages may be opted out of at any time using the unsubscri=
be link provided.=20
<br>
<br>
Your Rights and Choices=20
<br>
You may access, update, or request deletion of your personal information at=
 any time by contacting our support team. You can also manage your email pr=
eferences through any marketing communication you receive. Certain essentia=
l account or service-related messages may still be sent when needed.=20
<br>
<br>
Data Security and Retention=20
<br>
We take reasonable security measures to protect your data from unauthorized=
 access or misuse. Your information is retained only as long as required fo=
r legal, operational, or security purposes.=20
<br>
<br>
Third-Party Tools and Links=20
<br>
Our platform may include links or integrations from external websites or to=
ols. These third-party services operate independently, and we encourage you=
 to review their privacy policies before providing any personal information=
. NoGigiddy is not responsible for their practices.=20
<br>
<br>
Governing Law=20
<br>
This Privacy Policy is governed by the laws of the State of Georgia, United=
 States. Any disputes or claims related to this policy will be resolved und=
er applicable Georgia law.=20
<br>
<br>
